  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/w450-h640/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">封面作品</span></h3><div><div><span style=\"color: #0000ee; font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bong371.html\" target=\"_blank\">第一屆</a></span></div><div><span style=\"color: #0000ee; font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bong371.html\" target=\"_blank\">「全國台語政策民間會議」</a></span></div></div><div><br /></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">連署聲明</span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/dnvgxy\" target=\"_blank\">台語就是台語</a></span></h3><div><br /></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bong371-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語政策民間會議</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">施玉鳳<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_95.html\" target=\"_blank\">回復台語</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／許慧如</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／江宥呈<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_90.html\" target=\"_blank\">本土語言政策ê再轉型正義</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏維貞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bat-lan-e-kahe.html\" target=\"_blank\">用台語認bat lán ê環境</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bat-lan-e-kahe.html\" target=\"_blank\">——kah囡仔做伙學台語ê感想</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">6</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廖啟助<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/lan-tshua.html\" target=\"_blank\">免驚歹勢，lán tshuā頭來講台語</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳孟儒<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_39.html\" target=\"_blank\">台語欠詞按怎補？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／Kapoli Aturaturaw</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">（黃稚嘉）&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／李&nbsp; &nbsp; 維<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/eham-siraya.html\" target=\"_blank\">少年本土語創作者ê挑戰、進修hām未來創作發展</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/eham-siraya.html\" target=\"_blank\">——客語、台語、Siraya語做例</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">14<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／陳煥堂</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／林麗津<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_48.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣特色茶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 墨<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/hit-tooh.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hit-tooh！野球</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">徐智崗<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/bai.html\" target=\"_blank\">心bái無人知</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">40</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青鳥行動</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李鈺凰<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">美麗之島有一條路</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>21</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_52.html\" target=\"_blank\">麻糍</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_40.html\" target=\"_blank\">一枝小雨傘（二）：死對頭</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">簡櫻汝<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">參觀月世界「呂--家古厝」</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳煒翰</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e-tshia-iann.html\" target=\"_blank\">普濟風華ê tshia-iānn</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>29</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳錦月<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/ti_11.html\" target=\"_blank\">行tī大溪州路</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>31</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來唸七字仔</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楊國明（山人）<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2025/03/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">日本東北旅遊記事</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">34</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳春美<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/etsun.html\" target=\"_blank\">花開ê時tsūn</a><br />36</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/khe.html\" target=\"_blank\">早khé精神好</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>37</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張翰緯<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_80.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê心願</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>39</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i>Aminegy</i><br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/gong-gian-thau.html\" target=\"_blank\">Gōng-giàn-thâu</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>41</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhWWiVsbXBlE2h1UZhGElC7hTG6ZuPGmZSGtC8nlvJv0VYblKtQg1teUNQ11hjSN2k6x1c9QIlM63ZhbcBo8EpBqk8VVfqkPqoFj8nr5JuYRlVJ7fTpmi58PtIS1Pv10aGc9zglMRZ9ayp5PNUFYvuK3s8hk0XS2TBo_WsOmm-IHgBCjSU3IUcJ4CF2c8-y/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E8%A3%A1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhWWiVsbXBlE2h1UZhGElC7hTG6ZuPGmZSGtC8nlvJv0VYblKtQg1teUNQ11hjSN2k6x1c9QIlM63ZhbcBo8EpBqk8V